    alt="&#127757;"
    title="earth_africa"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f30d.svg"> Se il Mondo Dimenticasse Ieri… <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
